<title>USA: TABLE - MidSouth Bancorp Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - MidSouth Bancorp Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.32		    $0.22</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.28		    $0.20</p>
